==Battleground==
*1 [[Axoloty]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Johnnyleon]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*8 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 28.67~31.33 seconds<sup>860f~940f</sup>.
*1 [[Axoloty]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Axoloty]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Axoloty]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk Cat]] or other cheap and fast units to trigger the Axoloties' attacks, and use [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] or some other [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]] to counter the Zuches. Johnnyleon is easy to kill with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and other units with high DPS. If you want, bring [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Supercat]] to block Axoloty's [[Wave Attack|Waves]]. If one happens to own them, [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] is a great pick for this stage, as their massive DPS against Aliens and their [[Wave Immunity]] essentially trivialises this stage.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Dawn of the Beginning]] stages except [[Buried Hypocrisy]], The Ivory Oracle's name is the reverse of one from [[Dead End Night]], in this case [[Dark Premonition]] (ivory is white, the opposite of black).

